2. World Health Organization. WHO guidelines for malaria (رژیم‌های Primaquine؛ رژیم ۷ روزه 2022). Geneva: WHO.
3. WHO Prequalification. Primaquine 15 mg tablets (MA176) — Summary of Product Characteristics. 2024.
